Professor Juniper: Elesa called and was
asking me all about Electric-type{VAR BE00}
Pokémon, and I thought about you guys.{VAR BE01}
That's why I wanted to see you.
Ta-da! Freebies for you!{VAR BE01}

If you see a Pokémon that
you want to have join you,{VAR BE00}
be sure to use a good type of Poké Ball.{VAR BE01}
Because this could be the
first and last time you see that Pokémon!{VAR BE01}

I know it might seem strange for me
to say this, since I'm the one who asked{VAR BE00}
you to complete the Pokédex, but please,{VAR BE00}
remember to enjoy your journey!{VAR BE01}

Of course, I'm not saying you can just
neglect the Pokédex. But you know that!{VAR BE01}
Now, if you'll please excuse me,
I have to go meet Bianca.{VAR BE01}

Cheren: It seems the Professor
gave us the Pokédex as a reason{VAR BE00}
to send us on a journey.{VAR BE01}
At least, that's what my mom told me.{VAR BE01}
They wanted us to go out and see the
world, so my mom, Bianca's mom, and your{VAR BE00}
mom made a request to Professor Juniper.{VAR BE01}

{VAR 0100 0000}, what should we do now?{VAR BE01}
I think I'd like to show the professor my
thanks by going to Route 4 and catching{VAR BE00}
some Pokémon I haven't yet caught.{VAR BE01}
